{"title":"White Unicorn","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 52 Moonbeast that attacks with stab (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">shock</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">slash</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">freeze</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/moonhart-antler\">Moonhart Antler</a> <span class=\"muted\">(infuses an enchant)</span>. A small chance on any kill, far better from elites. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 1 looted corpse recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - in 0% of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 50 total, 50 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0% · 0/1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"dragonscale-head\" title=\"Dragonscale Head - in 100% of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/756e510937a28ef5481b.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dragonscale Head</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">100% · 1/1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Superior: 1 of 1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>in the wilds around 1481, 1417 <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"white-unicorn\">Show on map</button>\n      <h2>Named ones <span class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:14px\">(1)</span></h2><div class=\"named-grid\"><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/the-white-unicorn\"><img src=\"data/img/0a85e6d25c8ddf0ef188.webp\" alt=\"\"><b>The White Unicorn</b><span>Lv 52</span></a></div>\n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Moonbeast: <a href=\"#/monster/glimmerfox\">Glimmerfox</a> <span class=\"muted\">(41)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/moonhart\">Moonhart</a> <span class=\"muted\">(45)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/89721e78d24029b90339.webp\" alt=\"White Unicorn\"></div><h3>White Unicorn</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>52</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 52)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Moonbeast</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>stab · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>330</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>33.1</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>2,600</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>2.6 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>No</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>1 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}